  "description": "Reid Bikes eMetro 350W USA eBike | Folding Bike\nThe Reid Bikes eMetro USA eBike combines a compact design with electric assistance and practical components for everyday urban riding. Its lightweight alloy frame and sturdy steel fork provide a functional foundation for city journeys and leisure rides.\nA 350W rear hub motor delivers electric assistance, supported by a 10.4Ah frame-mounted battery with a 530Wh capacity. The Key Display KD58 LCD handlebar-mounted display provides clear ride information, while the thumb-operated throttle allows acceleration up to 32kph, offering added convenience when setting off and navigating urban streets.\nThe 7-speed L-TWOO trigger shifter works with a Shimano TY200 rear derailleur and Shimano 14–28T freewheel to provide versatile gearing for varied riding conditions. Tektro HD-M275 hydraulic disc brakes offer controlled stopping power, while 20 x 2.125-inch tyres mounted on double-wall rims provide grip and stability.\nWith its compact 20-inch wheels, practical gearing and electric assistance, the Reid Bikes eMetro USA eBike is designed to make everyday city travel straightforward and comfortable.\nThe Reid Bikes eMetro USA eBike is ideal for:\n\nUrban riders, with a compact design suited to city streets and cycle paths\n\nEveryday journeys, with a 350W rear hub motor and 530Wh battery\n\nRiders who value throttle assistance, with a thumb-operated throttle offering acceleration up to 32kph\n\nCyclists seeking versatile gearing, with a 7-speed drivetrain and Shimano rear derailleur\n\nRiders prioritising braking control, with Tektro hydraulic disc brakes\n\nCity and leisure riding, with 20 x 2.125-inch tyres and double-wall rims\n\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
